   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n    <li>The scatter plot below displays the elevation and median number of clear days per year of 14 U.S. cities. Two lines are shown on the scatter plot. Which line fits the data better?</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img alt=\"A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS ELEVATION ABOVE SEA LEVEL IN FEET ON THE X-AXIS AND MEAN NUMBER OF CLEAR DAYS ON THE Y-AXIS. TWO LINES OF FIT ARE SHOWN.\" height=\"396\" src=\"exercises/media/3fc3952bb038a904.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>",
